Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:09:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2020/3799] soh: rename func_808B4D9C ->
 BgSpot16Bombstone_InitBoulder

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the params 0 branch of Init: returns false when the switch flag is already set, otherwise sets up the boulder's scale, colliders and idle action
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c   | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
index ad9686da2..6728b2758 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
@@ -172,7 +172,8 @@ void BgSpot16Bombstone_InitCylinderCollider(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState*
     this->colliderCylinder.dim.pos.z += (s16)this->actor.world.pos.z;
 }
 
-s32 func_808B4D9C(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B4D9C: the params 0 branch of Init: returns false when the switch flag is already set, otherwise sets up the boulder's scale, colliders and idle action
+s32 BgSpot16Bombstone_InitBoulder(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (Flags_GetSwitch(play, this->switchFlag)) {
         osSyncPrintf("Spot16 obj 爆弾石 破壊済み\n");
         return false;
@@ -241,7 +242,7 @@ void BgSpot16Bombstone_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     switch (this->actor.params) {
         case 0xFF:
             // The boulder is intact
-            shouldLive = func_808B4D9C(this, play);
+            shouldLive = BgSpot16Bombstone_InitBoulder(this, play);  // was func_808B4D9C [LLM:HIGH]
             break;
         case 0:
         case 1:
